  "88e32609-ba13-4707-b1f1-55675afc4f5e"],
 " of the two pictures."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"42b92815-e641-4942-a687-39bc47d04f13"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The map is linear, and ",
